<title>UK: IBCA rates L-Bank 750 mln mark notes AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-Bank 750 mln mark notes AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Friday it assigned Baden-Wurttemberg L-Finance NV's 750 million mark 5.25 percent notes due 2001 a long-term rating of AAA.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg (L-Bank) and the rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-Bank, IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
